# .github/CODEOWNERS — makes the code-review agent a REQUIRED approver.
# With branch protection require_code_owner_reviews:true + required_approving_review_count:1,
# the agent's approval is required and NO human approval is needed.
#
# Replace the login/app-slug with your actual review agent (must equal review_agent_owner in
# branch_protection.example.yaml). App bots are referenced by their [bot] login.

*   @coderabbitai
# or, e.g.:
# *   @qodo-merge-pro
# *   @your-claude-review-app
